---
import Frame from '../layouts/frame.astro';
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
import ProfileCard from '../widgets/ProfileCard.astro';
import RecentPosts from '../widgets/RecentPosts.astro';
import WebsiteStatus from '../widgets/WebsiteStatus.astro';
---

<Frame
  title="👋 Welcome - Nayuta Theme"
  breadcrumbs={[{ text: 'Home', href: '/' }]}
>
  <ProfileCard slot="left" />
  <RecentPosts slot="left" />
  <WebsiteStatus slot="left" />

  <Prose>
    <h1 class="page-title">👋 Welcome</h1>
    <p>Hey there! I'm Leo Jia (@yuanzui_cf)</p>
    <p>
      Currently, I'm an undergraduate student, but I already have 6 years coding
      experience. I'm diving into Rust, Typescript and Go. I use <a href="#"
        >Zed</a
      > as my code editor. It's pretty nice - lightweight but convenient. I enjoy
      building small projects to practice new languages and patterns, and I'm always
      open to collaboration or feedback.
    </p>
    <p>
      When I'm not coding, I play games or watch anime. My favorite series is <a
        href="#">Puella Magi Madoka Magica</a
      > - it's a fantastic show I keep coming back to.
    </p>
    <p>
      Feel free to reach out on <a href="#">Telegram (@kami_madoka)</a> or check my
      GitHub to see my projects.
    </p>
  </Prose>
</Frame>
